# shell: desktop
# prefs: factory
# mkdir: /tmp/trk_home
wait 20
click 980 40
wait 4
menu-pick Applications
wait 4
menu-pick TikuReader
wait 40
expect-title TikuReader
note hover changes only chrome, not the rest of the desktop
move 216 86
wait 2
expect-same-as-redraw
move 218 87
wait 2
expect-same-as-redraw
move 450 400
wait 2
expect-same-as-redraw
note live drag frames must equal a complete repaint before release
press 161 50
move 241 100
wait 2
expect-window-at 170 90
expect-same-as-redraw
move 291 120
wait 2
expect-window-at 220 110
expect-same-as-redraw
move 70 50
wait 2
expect-same-as-redraw
release 70 50
wait 4
expect-same-as-redraw
note resize invalidates content and updates the real controller
key f ctrl
wait 4
expect-narrate Find
expect-same-as-redraw
quit
